  "_key": "!scenes!79290bce4cf94fb5",
  "description": "<p>The shopfront. Fetish material worth about <strong>2,500¥</strong> remains, and it is obvious at a glance the store has not been used for some time.</p><p>Two entrances — the main door and a back door to the alley. Both are closed and locked at <strong>Barrier Rating 5</strong>. The alley door's lock is in better condition and shows evidence of recent use.</p><p><strong>Rooms:</strong> —</p><p><em>Layout derived from the printed floorplan on Queen Euphoria p.40. Measured 17 × 6 m by grid period (41 px, both axes); walls measured off the generated art — the map carries a \"□ = 1 metre\" legend, so the scale is the book's, not an estimate.</em></p>"
